WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.302
-Higgins, want to explain
how this works?

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.435
Higgins, come on.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:03.435 --> 00:00:05.371
Come on.
-You'll choose a category.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:06.739
-Okay.
-Right?

00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:09.074
Then you'll take turns
naming things in that category.

00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:11.077
Gotcha.
-Okay, whosever clock

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.313
runs out first, loses the round.
-Okay.

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:15.548
-And if you think
your opponent said something

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.850
that doesn't fit that category,

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.418
you can hit
the challenge button.

00:00:19.418 --> 00:00:21.020
[ Horn blares ]

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.722
-And call their bluff.
And you call their bluff.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:25.091
Yep, and the judges say
yes or no.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.191
-Okay.
-We're gonna take a look

00:00:26.191 --> 00:00:28.994
at the categories.
They are...

00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:30.697
Superheroes.
-Oof.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.765
-Herbs and spices.
-"Erbs," I think.

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:33.933
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.835
-"Rarck" bands.
-Rock bands.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.037
-French "wards."
-French words.

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:41.040
-"Animils" with tails.
-Animals with tails.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.309
-And 16th century
Swedish architects.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.743
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:47.313
Margot, why don't you pick
the first category?

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.915
-I would have to go with
the thing I know most about

00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:52.085
and say 16th-century
Swedish architects.

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:53.286
[ Laughter ]
-All right, these --

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:57.690
Any Swedish architect
from the 16th century.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.526
20 seconds on the clock.

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:01.027
Margot, hit your button
when you're ready.

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:04.330
And go.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.866
-Uh...
Hugen Flu Flugen.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.035
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:11.103
-Challenging that.
[ Horn blares ]

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:12.672
-Judges?

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:15.941
[ Buzzer ]
Oh! You got it wrong.

00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:17.644
Margot gets that round.
Okay.

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:20.079
[ Laughter ]
Jimmy, your turn.

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:21.915
-Wait.
-Pick a category.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.616
-All right,
we start back from 20, right?

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:25.384
-Yep, start back from 20.
Reset the clock.

00:01:25.384 --> 00:01:27.153
-All right, my category.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.789
I'm gonna go with herbs --
herbs and -- herbs and spices.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:31.391
[ Laughter ]
-Okay.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:36.496
This is any herb or spice,
according to herbwisdom.com.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:37.930
So don't get nuts.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.198
If it's not on Herb Wisdom,
you don't get the points.

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:40.967
-Sounds like a reliable source,
okay.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.303
-Sounds like a weed thing.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.404
-Dr. Weed, yeah.
I get all my herbs from there.

00:01:45.404 --> 00:01:47.173
-All right, so, who goes first?
-You start, you start. Ready?

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.241
-All right,
so I press it, right?

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.709
-Yep.
-There you go.

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:51.677
Rosemary.
-Oregano.

00:01:51.677 --> 00:01:55.381
-Uh, uh, uh --
She said oregano.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:59.151
Sorry, I'm gonna say --
Sorry, chives.

00:01:59.151 --> 00:02:02.489
-Chives.
-Um, um, parsley.

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:05.824
-Italian parsley.
-Italian parsley. Ooh!

00:02:05.824 --> 00:02:08.460
-Cumin.
-I'm gonna say, uh, uh...

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.663
Oh, my gosh.
Red -- Red pepper.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.765
-Red pepper!
-Turmeric.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.201
-Pepper.
-Salt.

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:16.870
-Uh...

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.204
