00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:20.606
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:23.743
-Oh-ho-ho!
Are you gonna hit the challenge?

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:25.410
-Paprika.
-Oh!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.880
-Oh!
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.182
Wow!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:31.350
-Thanks.
-Wow!

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:32.518
-I thought
I was gonna win that one.

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:35.121
-Jimmy, I'm on form tonight.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:38.057
-You're ready to go.
-You're spicy.

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:39.291
[ Air horn ]

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:41.628
